OL,3,ANew police team to crack down on
OL,4,Aillegal number plates across England
OL,5,
OL,6,FA centralised crackdown on illegal
OL,7,Fnumber plates will target organised
OL,8,Fcrime groups and drivers who dodge
OL,9,Ffines by bringing together data and
OL,10,Finformation from police forces across
OL,11,FEngland, the government has said.
OL,13,FThe newly-created National Roads
OL,14,FPolicing Coordination Centre (NRPCC)
OL,15,Fwill see improved collaboration across
OL,16,Fforces as well as new technology, such
OL,17,Fas specialist goggles that can detect
OL,18,Fnumber plates that have been made
OL,19,Funreadable to cameras.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
