OL,3,ANew police team to crack down on
OL,4,Aillegal number plates across England
OL,5,
OL,6,FIllegal number plates are often used by
OL,7,Forganised crime groups to move stolen
OL,8,Fgoods and to evade speeding, parking
OL,9,Fand clean air zone penalties, the
OL,10,FDepartment for Transport (DfT) said.
OL,12,FDrivers with incorrectly displayed or
OL,13,Fmissing number plates can be fined up
OL,14,Fto #1,000.
